Changes: C++ front-view coordinate planning, GGML feature sampling, explicit
backend selection, sparse index order preservation and numerical test driver.
This component does not include model weights.

trellis.cpp and its GGML checkout are external, pinned build dependencies;
their notices and licenses remain in those source/runtime distributions.

The projected DiT patch modifies trellis.cpp include/dit.h and src/dit.cpp,
revision 2516c48b677050c570f47eba2e68dc8a5bc918b0.
Copyright (c) 2026 Piotr Wilkin. MIT license: see LICENSE.trellis.
Changes: optional per-block projected conditioning, strict input checks and
opt-in F32 GELU for numerical parity. The original runtime is not modified.

native/flow_runner.cpp adapts GGUF loading, timestep embedding and RoPE formulas
from trellis.cpp src/trellis_model.cpp and src/flow_runner.cpp at the same pin.
Its Euler/CFG/interval sampling follows TencentARC/Pixal3D
pixal3d/pipelines/samplers/{flow_euler,classifier_free_guidance_mixin,
guidance_interval_mixin}.py and modules/sparse/basic.py at the pin above.
Changes: borrowed explicit backend, typed positive/negative projected conditions,
fixed texture concatenation, bounded validation, cancellation/progress hooks,
graph reuse and non-finite failure instead of silent numerical repair.
These adaptations are covered by the corresponding MIT licenses above.

native/image_features.cpp adapts the DINOv3 GGML graph from trellis.cpp
src/dinov3.cpp at the pinned revision above. Changes: configurable dimensions,
strict input/weight validation, ImageNet normalization, explicit backend support
checks, resource cleanup, CLS/register/patch splitting and diagnostic outputs.
Image feature selection, LR/HR projection concatenation and zero negative
conditioning follow TencentARC/Pixal3D's image_conditioned_proj.py at its pin.
prepare_image.py preserves the reference Pillow resize/RGB order. Foreground
removal, NAF, MoGe and pretrained model weights are not included in this slice.
